ter every required action receipt/current proof and custody gate passes. No Bootstrap/model/reviewer/Knowledge publication/remote push is requested. Windows unrun remains unverified.\",\"Preserve all real Knowledge changes including tracked deletion followed by ignored mutex recreation. Only the exact untracked ignored stable regular single-link one-NUL-byte publisher acquisition guard is metadata. Retain both independent affected repair reviews and every old failure.\"],\"reviewedCheckpoint\":\"82ee682bcc5279729b4a9ea87eba6ccbf086e351\",\"schema_version\":\"jimuyun.acceptance-input-projection.v1\",\"targetPlan\":\"execution-plans/2026-10-28-skill-compliance-package-b-rebuild-r3\",\"unitSupervisor\":{\"path\":\"execution-plans/2026-10-28-skill-compliance-package-b-rebuild-r3/acceptance-inputs/preparation-mutex-20261028/unit-budget.py\",\"sha256\":\"sha256:2311b0d511912e287414514cdf60577664b8d100bae70c1c2842e07c46dcdc5d\"}}\n"}
